# Language Configuration

**Agent chat language**: CHAT_LANGUAGE_PLACEHOLDER

## Language Settings

- **Agent chat language**: Language for communication with Kiro AI agent (configurable)
- **Project language**: English (fixed for all projects)

## Spec Document Translation

When agent chat language is not English, spec documents are created in both languages:
- `requirements.md` (English) + `requirements_LANGUAGE_CODE.md` (Chat language)
- `design.md` (English) + `design_LANGUAGE_CODE.md` (Chat language)
- `tasks.md` (English) + `tasks_LANGUAGE_CODE.md` (Chat language)

Translation is handled automatically by hooks.

## Notes

- Project files (README, Issues, PRs, commits) are always in English
- Only agent chat and spec documents use the configured chat language
- Global configuration (~/.kiro/) is always in English
